# This directory is intentionally empty: all sound effects in BMS Carrom
# are generated procedurally in code (see scripts/sfx.gd), so there are
# no .wav files. This placeholder exists because Git does not track empty
# directories, and the CI workflow's "Normalize binary assets" step does
# os.listdir("audio") — without this file the directory is missing from
# the checkout and the build fails (run #1, 2026-11-22).
